# Repo-root Docker build context. Used by:
#   * docker-postgres/Dockerfile        -> ghcr.io/semantius/postgres
#   * pgdocker/docker-compose.ext.yml    -> Dockerfile.ext (COPYs the extension)
# (The base pgdocker build uses context ./pgdocker and is unaffected by this file.)
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include ONLY the paths a build COPYs, so the context
# stays tiny. Nested paths need the parent dirs un-ignored first (the `apps/*`
# then `!apps/nwind` chain), then re-excluded, so only the one subtree comes in.
*

# Generated extension (.control + versioned SQL).
!extension

# semantius/postgres build inputs: pg_hba, first-init scripts, Dockerfile, build scripts.
!docker-postgres

# Northwind demo module — the two migrations merged into the image at build time.
!apps
apps/*
!apps/nwind
apps/nwind/*
!apps/nwind/migrations
